(6669903, 997162, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, a well-taken image, I like it.</td>', 'Nice DOF, a well-taken image, I like it.', '2012-02-10 10:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669906, 997115, 94265, '<td valign="top">The shot is a little bit noisy but it''s a very nice modelling shot, always good to see a photographer who is happy to promote curvier girls.</td>', 'The shot is a little bit noisy but it''s a very nice modelling shot, always good to see a photographer who is happy to promote curvier girls.', '2012-02-10 10:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669910, 997975, 94265, '<td valign="top">I do really like this shot, good composition and DOF, nice tones; I can''t help but think though that simply writing the ''sorry'' would have made better sense. The suggestion is obviously that her lover has ditched her and left their keys - portraying that said lover would be in touch again soon doesn''t seem to fit the idea. Overall though, I really like this.</td>', 'I do really like this shot, good composition and DOF, nice tones; I can''t help but think though that simply writing the ''sorry'' would have made better sense. The suggestion is obviously that her lover has ditched her and left their keys - portraying that said lover would be in touch again soon doesn''t seem to fit the idea. Overall though, I really like this.', '2012-02-10 10:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669912, 998071, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot, nice clear focus and good exposure, I like the set-up too. Well done.</td>', 'This is a really good shot, nice clear focus and good exposure, I like the set-up too. Well done.', '2012-02-10 10:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669917, 998099, 94265, '<td valign="top">One of the more creative entries, I love this idea, made me chuckle. I think I''d have taken this landscape rather than have that needless sky at the top of the shot in portrait but if that''s your own hand, I can see that hanging the camera portrait would have been far easier for you. Good job on the shot either way, hope it does well.</td>', 'One of the more creative entries, I love this idea, made me chuckle. I think I''d have taken this landscape rather than have that needless sky at the top of the shot in portrait but if that''s your own hand, I can see that hanging the camera portrait would have been far easier for you. Good job on the shot either way, hope it does well.', '2012-02-10 10:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669919, 997859, 94265, '<td valign="top">Love the old typewriter and dying flowers, I could see this being the cover of a romance novel. Good lighting/exposure too. I''m not sure how closely it relates to the song but I like it.</td>', 'Love the old typewriter and dying flowers, I could see this being the cover of a romance novel. Good lighting/exposure too. I''m not sure how closely it relates to the song but I like it.', '2012-02-10 10:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669922, 997582, 94265, '<td valign="top">The contrast could do with a boost, great exposure otherwise. A very nice shot and a good model, doesn''t quite fit in with the song to me but still a good idea.</td>', 'The contrast could do with a boost, great exposure otherwise. A very nice shot and a good model, doesn''t quite fit in with the song to me but still a good idea.', '2012-02-10 10:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6669925, 998035, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how well this relates to the song (everything about it suggests no break-up) but you''ve chosen a lovely model and the shot is really good, the lipstick is nicely vibrant.</td>', 'I''m not sure how well this relates to the song (everything about it suggests no break-up) but you''ve chosen a lovely model and the shot is really good, the lipstick is nicely vibrant.', '2012-02-10 10:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
