(6680498, 997975, 137576, '<td valign="top">5 hours before roll over I was higher than the blue, I don''t get how it can sit at 6.5+ all week then drop so much in 4 and a bit hours, lowest number of votes in top 10 as well. it''s a conspiracy I tell you lol, <br/> <br/>Annoyed it didn''t ribbon, setting high standards for myself and striving to achieve them had this idea from get go, popped to mates florist and got the rose and card and shot this. Should have just wrote sorry! But the implication as some got was he was lying to soften the blow and the clearing of his guilt like it made it better he''d left a rose. <br/> <br/>To those who think this is rough my sons mum deleted our relationship on Facebook and me as a friend that was the way she announced shed been cheating on me for 4 months but that was two years ago now but haha that''s the rough way to do it lol :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-17 02:32:24.</i></td>', '5 hours before roll over I was higher than the blue, I don''t get how it can sit at 6.5+ all week then drop so much in 4 and a bit hours, lowest number of votes in top 10 as well. it''s a conspiracy I tell you lol,  Annoyed it didn''t ribbon, setting high standards for myself and striving to achieve them had this idea from get go, popped to mates florist and got the rose and card and shot this. Should have just wrote sorry! But the implication as some got was he was lying to soften the blow and the clearing of his guilt like it made it better he''d left a rose.  To those who think this is rough my sons mum deleted our relationship on Facebook and me as a friend that was the way she announced shed been cheating on me for 4 months but that was two years ago now but haha that''s the rough way to do it lol :)', '2012-02-17 02:30:44.000000', '2012-02-17 02:32:24.000000', 0),
